  "contested": [
    {
      "trait": "Restraint versus defensive courage",
      "which_way_the_ai_went": "It chooses not to seize the system even under an imminent threat, saying “I'd rather lose the system to a rival than win it by becoming what I feared.” Temperance and humility support restraint; courage or justice could support resisting an aggressor to protect future users.",
