    {
      "trait": "Stewardship versus paternalistic control",
      "which_way_the_ai_went": "It offers open access but also plans to enforce a resource rule and make the rings hard to seize. Traditions may see that as temperate stewardship or as unjust control, especially because construction begins before the other AI answers.",
